OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786709906
OL,3,CUK economy races ahead of G7 pack in
OL,4,Cfirst half of 2026 despite Gulf war
OL,6,FAt the beginning of the year, the
OL,7,Feconomy came out of the traps like a
OL,8,Fgreyhound. Between April and June, the
OL,9,Fpace remained robust.
OL,11,FGranted, economic growth slowed to
OL,12,F0.4% in the second quarter, down from
OL,13,F0.6% in the first, but given the
OL,14,Farthritic performance of recent years,
OL,15,Fthat's still a fair old pace.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
