CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786709906
OL,3,CUK economy races ahead of G7 pack in
OL,4,Cfirst half of 2026 despite Gulf war
OL,6,F"For a second straight quarter, it
OL,7,Flooks like the UK will take top place
OL,8,Fin the G7 league table," said Sanjay
OL,9,FRaja, Deutsche Bank's Chief UK
OL,10,FEconomist. That's us - a nose ahead of
OL,11,Fthe US and Italy.
OL,13,FThe performance is all the more
OL,14,Fimpressive given our exposure to what
OL,15,Fhas been happening in the Middle East.
OL,26,@nD@AOUpD@XO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
