OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786709906
OL,3,CUK economy races ahead of G7 pack in
OL,4,Cfirst half of 2026 despite Gulf war
OL,6,FThe war in Iran has caused the
OL,7,Finternational market price of oil to
OL,8,Flurch upwards, dragging the price of
OL,9,Fmany other things up too - fanning
OL,10,Finflation and keeping interest rates
OL,11,Fhigher than they otherwise would be.
OL,13,FMotorists have felt it at the pumps
OL,14,Fand homeowners have felt it when they
OL,15,Fhave come to remortgage.
OL,17,FBut amid the political turmoil and the
OL,18,Fheatwaves, and perhaps gripped by
OL,19,FWorld Cup fever, households ramped up
OL,20,Ftheir spending in June.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786709906
OL,3,CUK economy races ahead of G7 pack in
OL,4,Cfirst half of 2026 despite Gulf war
OL,6,FGovernment support for the economy
OL,7,Ffaded as public investment fell but
OL,8,Fbusiness investment surged.
OL,10,FThere are plenty of reasons for the
OL,11,Fnew prime minister to feel hopeful.
OL,13,FThe evidence suggests Andy Burnham has
OL,14,Fcome to power at a time when consumer
OL,15,Fconfidence is improving, people are
OL,16,Ffeeling more secure in their jobs and
OL,17,Fmore willing to spend on non-
OL,18,Fessentials. Retail sales, car sales
OL,19,Fand bank lending all look strong.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1786709906
OL,3,CUK economy races ahead of G7 pack in
OL,4,Cfirst half of 2026 despite Gulf war
OL,6,FGross Domestic Product per person in
OL,7,Fthe UK - the economic measure which
OL,8,Fmatters most for living standards -
OL,9,Falso rose by 0.4% between April and
OL,10,FJune. Nothing to crow about, perhaps,
OL,11,Fbut one of the better performances
OL,12,Fsince the pandemic.
OL,14,FThe new chancellor is channellinfg the
OL,15,Fgood vibes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
